This issue is the spike. The pre-tool hook reads this marker and
suspends the TDD red-before-green strategy (`S2`) - code edits are not blocked,
because exploration code is throwaway and red-before-green is the wrong
discipline for it.

Written by the router at triage. Removed only if the spike is re-assessed onto a
delivery approach (graduation), where the marker no longer applies and the
guardrails apply in full.
